WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
How long do you have? Ten seconds, a minute, five minutes, or ten.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.200
Software engineer in Pune. I build data pipelines by day, run ultras at dawn, climb Sahyadri forts on weekends, and write in English and Marathi.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.550
The engineer. 25 projects shipped. Data pipelines by day.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.950
The runner. 26 races. 598 km on race day.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.350
The trekker. 20 Sahyadri forts. Some take two hours. One took twenty-two..

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.750
The reader and writer. 52 books, 22 in Marathi. 112 essays · 1,677 short posts.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.150
The citizen. Technology policy, studied in public. Tools that work in Marathi.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.200
How I work: Every number has a source. Accessibility is the floor, not a feature. Built for the people who use it. Phones on slow networks first. Ship in days, then keep going. Privacy by default.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Read me in ten seconds, or ten minutes. sankettambare.in/about
